			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Dependency and Element submodules to latest upstream revisions\n\nUpdate the Dependency submodule to Tauri upstream commit abc01a85, incorporating permission table reformatting across dialog, fs, log, and shell plugins from flat tab-indented format to expanded multi-line structure with blank line separation. Also fixes seven TauriSearch pattern guide test fixtures (bridge.md, cloudbridge.md, cloudish.md, glui.md, hermit.md, lockdown.md, multiwin.md) by removing duplicate `</rater>` closing tags that created invalid nested markup.\n\nUpdate the Element submodule across all internal components (Mountain, Cocoon, Wind, Sky, Output, Common, Echo, Rest, Worker, Air, Grove, Maintain, SideCar, Vine) to synchronize with latest upstream revisions.\n\nKeeps the Land editor's dependency tree aligned with upstream formatting improvements and bug fixes without altering semantic content in the application layer.",
			"SHA": "8c2e765245e70790994e2acb168efd7162e8fe4a"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-05T07:41:42Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				146,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule to latest upstream revisions\n\nUpdate the Element submodule across all internal components (Mountain, Cocoon, Wind, Sky, Output, Common, Echo, Rest, Worker, Air, Grove, Maintain, SideCar, Vine) to synchronize with upstream.\n\nMountain consolidates FileReadAlias into FileSystem with Matches updates, removes Clone derives from application state in favor of SharedApplicationState, adds SCMHandleCounter for source-control provider handle management, enhances ExtensionRegistry provider handle and command registry access, and resolves issues 64, 65, 67, 68. Cocoon updates @effect/platform-node to 0.107.0, protobufjs to 8.6.0, Vitest to 4.1.8, normalizes ESBuild configs, and regenerates RouteManifest with three new FileWatcher RPC methods (Unwatch, Watch, WatchStatus) increasing method count from 142 to 145. Wind applies automated formatting across 200+ Effect-TS service interfaces and ESBuild configs. Sky upgrades Astro to 6.4.4 and Vite to 8.0.16. Output expands architectural comments documenting Electron→Tauri+Effect-TS transformation rationale. Common and Echo update @cloudflare/workers-types to 4.20260605.1; Echo also bumps miniflare to 4.20260603.0 and wrangler to 4.98.0. Remaining submodules receive mechanical formatting improvements.\n\nAll changes maintain API compatibility with no breaking changes.",
			"SHA": "47083961939c4f2b95943554e4d2d022b6dc69c9"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
