				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Dependency and Element submodules to upstream\n\nUpdate Dependency submodule to upstream Tauri commit 07e24c9f, continuing ongoing dependency alignment without altering semantic content in the Land application layer.\n\nUpdate Element submodule across all internal submodules to latest upstream revisions. Mountain introduces stable workspace identifier, completes CreateEffectForRequest refactoring with Matches pre-filters and parameter borrowing to reduce clone overhead on the hot dispatch path, fixes ActiveOperations leak on RPC cancellation, and applies Vine filesystem corrections for WriteFile byte-array decoding and Stat empty-path ordering. Wind fixes SCM duplicate registration by excluding folderUri when workspace is present in ResolveConfiguration. Cocoon regenerates RouteManifest to include FileWatcher.Unwatch, FileWatcher.Watch, and FileWatcher.WatchStatus methods and rebuilds compiled artifacts across bootstrap, effect, service, handler, gRPC, and dual-track layers. Remaining submodules advance with minor formatting normalizations and CI dependency bumps.",
